      "message": "```suggestion\n\n// prebuilt_radio installs a firmware file to \u003cpartition\u003e/etc/radio directory for system\n// image.\n// If soc_specific property is set to true, the radio file is installed to the\n// vendor \u003cpartition\u003e/radio directory for vendor image.\nfunc PrebuiltRadioFactory() android.Module {\n        module :\u003d \u0026PrebuiltEtc{}\n        module.socInstallDirBase \u003d \"radio\"\n        InitPrebuiltEtcModule(module, \"etc/radio\")\n        // This module is device-only\n        android.InitAndroidArchModule(module, android.DeviceSupported, android.MultilibFirst)\n        android.InitDefaultableModule(module)\n        return module\n}\n\n```",
